/magazine/should-you-tell-uber-your-driver-was-high.html', 'snippet': 'The magazine’s ethicist columnist on whether to report a driver you believe was DUI and whether to tell your friend’s divorce lawyer about the illegal actions of her ex.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While traveling with my daughter and granddaughters, I booked an Uber car to go to the airport. When I got in the car, I smelled marijuana. Because we were running late and there was a lot of traffic, I stayed in the car, though my instinct was to get out and order a taxi.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05ethicist/05mag-05ethicist-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05ethicist/05mag-05ethicist-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05ethicist/05mag-05ethicist-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05ethicist/05mag-05ethicist-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 855, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05ethicist/05mag-05ethicist-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 855}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05ethicist/05mag-05ethicist-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 719, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05ethicist/05mag-05ethicist-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1160, 'width': 814, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Should You Tell Uber Your Driver Was High?', 'kicker': 'The Ethicist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Should I Tell Uber My Driver Was High?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Personal)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Uber Technologies Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxicabs and Taxicab Drivers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-01T10:00:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kwame Anthony Appiah', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kwame', 'middlename': 'Anthony', 'lastname': 'Appiah', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d55d05d-6667-5a4d-ac78-b55c5bde3582', 'word_count': 1422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d55d05d-6667-5a4d-ac78-b55c5bde3582'}, {'abstract': 'Through his stripped-down, radically humane approach to theater, Sam Gold has found a new dimension to a classic American play.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/01/magazine/sam-gold-the-glass-menagerie-the-experimentalist-on-broadway.html', 'snippet': 'Through his stripped-down, radically humane approach to theater, Sam Gold has found a new dimension to a classic American play.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One evening in early February, an eager crowd attended a public dress rehearsal of Sam Gold’s new Broadway production of “The Glass Menagerie,” which will open on March 9. The audience faced a barren stage: no curtain, no backdrop, nothing more than a folding table with a bowl of apples on it and an industrial shelf with a few props. They couldn’t have known that this banal view had been elaborately — and expensively — produced. The exposed pipes stretching across the vast black brick wall of the theater had been installed by the set designer, as had the sprinkler system. Sixty thousand pounds of concrete were poured to create the effect of an unremarkable gray floor.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05gold1/05gold1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05gold1/05gold1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05gold1/05gold1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05gold1/05gold1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05gold1/05gold1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05gold1/05gold1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05gold1/05gold1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1537, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cro