Space” to Joe’s Pub at the Public Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man of many talents, Ethan Lipton — a performer, playwright, composer and musician — has been equally multifarious in his choice of subject matter: For his charming cabaret piece “No Place to Go,” he faced the problems of relocating to Mars for work; he spent time with zombies and outlaws in the Old West for the sublimely silly horse opera “Tumacho;” and he hunkered down empathetically amid the monotony of the everyday office in shows like “Red-Handed Otter.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05GUIDE4/05GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05GUIDE4/05GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05GUIDE4/05GUIDE4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05GUIDE4/05GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 481, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05GUIDE4/05GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 481}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05GUIDE4/05GUIDE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 821, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05GUIDE4/05GUIDE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1641, 'width'