cause General McMaster is on active duty and the Senate votes on any major change in assignment for general officers, it will take up his appointment on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Senate does not usually get a chance to vote on who serves as the president’s national security adviser, but it will have a rare opportunity to weigh in next week when it considers the appointment of Lt. Gen. H. R. McMaster.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Senate Will Weigh In on H. R. McMaster’s Appointment', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McMaster, H R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-02T00:06:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20d6499a-14a9-5646-84ce-76c6877233e1', 'word_count': 238, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20d6499a-14a9-5646-84ce-76c6877233e1'}, {'abstract': 'Two law enforcement leaders discuss the wisdom of the Trump administration’s initial retreat from an aggressive stance on civil rights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/01/us/justice-department-police-law-enforcement.html', 'snippet': 'Two law enforcement leaders discuss the wisdom of the Trump administration’s initial retreat from an aggressive stance on civil rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Blue lives matter. That is, in es