}, {'abstract': 'The city’s strong theater community is increasingly keeping its audiences fed and watered in-house.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/travel/chicago-theaters-nightlife-restaurants-entertainment.html', 'snippet': 'The city’s strong theater community is increasingly keeping its audiences fed and watered in-house.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a spring evening last year, shortly after Steppenwolf Theater in Chicago opened an addition with a new theater and a lounge, the city’s mayor Rahm Emanuel was possibly the only audience member not to hit the new bar. He remained in the lobby of the Lincoln Park venue while the cast members from two of the three theaters in the complex, one director and a healthy contingent of patrons headed off to order rum-based Balm in Gileads and bourbon East of Edens while discussing the performances. Another set of showgoers filed off, drinks in hand, for a late-night show featuring the actress Laurie Metcalf.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/travel/5HEADSUP1/5HEADSUP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/05/travel/5HEADSUP1/5HEADSUP1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/travel/5HEADSUP1/5HEADSUP1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/travel/5HEADSUP1/5HEADSUP1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/05/travel/5HEADSUP1/5HEADSUP1-art