ment came after a day of rapid-fire developments that intensified pressure for a full investigation into Moscow’s meddling in the election.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/us/politics/jeff-sessions-russia-trump-investigation-democrats.html', 'snippet': 'The announcement came after a day of rapid-fire developments that intensified pressure for a full investigation into Moscow’s meddling in the election.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Attorney General Jeff Sessions, facing a storm of criticism over newly disclosed contacts with the Russian ambassador to the United States, recused himself on Thursday from any investigation into charges that Russia meddled in the 2016 presidential election.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeff Sessions Recuses Himself From Russia Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sessions Recuses Himself  From Russia Investigation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sessions, Jefferson B III', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Flynn, Michael T', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kislyak, Sergei I', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cyberwarfare and Defense', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-02T08:14:27+0000', 'doc