g. Pregnant with her first child, she stood in the kitchen of her home on the North Fork of Long Island and stirred a pan of cabbage and butter. Her husband, Vincent Catalano, was upstairs painting the baby’s room. Petersson had a bowl of ground meat on the counter beside her, some potatoes, a small glass of cream. It was her grandmother’s recipe she was making, she said, a kind of cabbage meatloaf that she remembered from childhood outside Gothenburg, in Sweden. Kalpudding, it’s called. You serve it with lingonberries. I wanted to eat it right away.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05eat/05mag-05eat-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05eat/05mag-05eat-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05eat/05mag-05eat-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05eat/05eat-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05eat/05eat-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05eat/05eat-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/magazine/05eat/05eat-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1527, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Caramelized Cabbage Casserole to Get You to Spring', 'kicker': 'Eat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Swedish Season', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meatloaf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cabbage', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sweden', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nilsson, Magnus', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-02T10:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3fa35a3d-a7f7-57bd-8606-9d37d6b78afc', 'word_count': 814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3fa35a3d-a7f7-57bd-8606-9d37d6b78afc'}, {'abstract': 'An FX limited series starring Jessica Lange and Susan Sarandon focuses on Joan Crawford and Bette Davis in 1962. It’s jolting how modern the issues feel.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/arts/television/feud-fx-ryan-murphy-jessica-lange-susan-sarandon.html', 'snippet': 'An FX limited series starring Jessica Lange and Susan Sarandon focuses on Joan Crawford and Bette Davis in 1962. It’s jolting how modern the issues feel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few Hollywood stars were as big as Bette Davis and Joan Crawford, and few fought as hard for their rightful place in the industry. Decade after decade, they powered through good and forgettable films with million-dollar smiles, gushers of tears and thrilling emotion. They champed at the studio bit and become immortals, all the while enduring the brutalities of business, the capriciousness of the fans and the mercenary attentions of the press. By the time each hit 50, though, the old studio system was in steep decline and these two survivors had started scrambling in the rubble.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05FUED/05FUED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05FUED/05FUED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05FUED/05FUED-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05FUED/05FUED-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05FUED/05FUED-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05FUED/05FUED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05FUED/05FUED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Feud’ Asks, Again: What Ever Happened to Roles for Women?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stars. Rivals. Victims.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'FX (TV Network)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Feud: Bette and Joan (TV Program)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murphy, Ryan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lange, Jessica', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sarandon, Susan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crawford, Joan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Bette', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-02T10:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddd6bd41-552e-5826-893c-c887d6a23edc', 'word_count': 1980, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddd6bd41-552e-5826-893c-c887d6a23edc'}, {'abstract': 'In a season rife with demonstrations, Republican legislators in at least 16 states have filed bills to make protests more orderly or to toughen penalties.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/us/when-does-protest-cross-a-line-some-states-aim-to-toughen-laws.html', 'snippet': 'In a season rife with demonstrations, Republican legislators in at least 16 states have filed bills to make protests more orderly or to toughen penalties.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BISMARCK, N.D. — About an hour after some 200 police officers cleared the last demonstrators against the Dakota Access Pipeline from their sprawling encampment on the North Dakota prairie last week, Gov. Doug Burgum signed into law four bills aimed at making it easi