ugees try to fashion a sense of normalcy with businesses and home-cooked meals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year after the European Union closed its borders to stem a crush of asylum seekers, tens of thousands still languish in camps inside Greece. For them, a life in limbo has taken on an air of permanence. They outfit unfamiliar surroundings with the trappings of home, seeking a semblance of normalcy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/world/europe/xxgreece-slide-2IO2/xxgreece-slide-2IO2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/02/22/world/europe/xxgreece-slide-2IO2/xxgreece-slide-2IO2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/world/europe/xxgreece-slide-2IO2/xxgreece-slide-2IO2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/world/europe/xxgreece-slide-2IO2/xxgreece-slide-2IO2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/world/europe/xxgreece-slide-2IO2/xxgreece-slide-2IO2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/02/22/world/europe/xxgreece-slide-2IO2/xxgreece-slide-2IO2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/02/22/world/europe/xxgreece-slide-2IO2/xxgreece-slide-2I