ctations for cutting costs in its deal for SABMiller, but it is getting harder to squeeze out more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anheuser-Busch InBev’s flair for cutting costs is being blunted by complexity. The megabrewer now expects annual savings from its merger with SABMiller to reach $2.8 billion, 14 percent more than an earlier estimate. Yet the upgrade is significantly smaller than with previous purchases. Taking on bigger targets is testing its approach.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'AB InBev Finds Complexity Is a Drag on Savings', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Anheuser-Busch InBev NV', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SABMiller', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-02T20:02:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Ryan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/222410b9-677f-525a-9c1d-30331353903a', 'word_count': 356, 'uri': 'nyt://article/222410b9-677f-525a-9c1d-30331353903a'}, {'abstract': 'The country’s top appeals court cleared the ex-president of any responsibility for the killing of hundreds of people during the 2011 protests that ended his 30-year rule.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/world/middleeast/hosni-mubarak-release-egypt-court.html', 'snippet': 'The country’s top appeals court cleared the ex-president of any responsibility for the killing of hundreds of people during the 2011 protests that ended his 30-year rule.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Egypt’s top appeals court cleared former President Hosni Mubarak of any responsibility for the killing of hundreds of people during the 2011 protests that ended his 30-year rule, sweeping away the final legal hurdle to Mr. Mubarak’s release from detention.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Mubarak/03Mubarak-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Mubarak/03Mubarak-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Mubarak/03Mubarak-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Mubarak/03Mubarak-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1331, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Mubarak/03Mubarak-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Mubarak/03Mubarak-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Mubarak/03Mubarak-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Egyptian Court Clears Way for Hosni Mubarak’s Release', 'kicker': Non