', 'word_count': 726, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d01305f-2567-5768-aca8-7db0b50d0076'}, {'abstract': 'Alexei A. Navalny, an anticorruption crusader, said in a report that Mr. Medvedev had amassed a lavish empire of luxury properties, yachts and a vineyard in Italy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/world/europe/russia-dmitri-medvedev-aleksei-navalny.html', 'snippet': 'Alexei A. Navalny, an anticorruption crusader, said in a report that Mr. Medvedev had amassed a lavish empire of luxury properties, yachts and a vineyard in Italy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Prime Minister Dmitri A. Medvedev of Russia has built a lavish empire of mansions, country estates, luxury yachts, an Italian vineyard and an 18th-century palace in St. Petersburg, the Kremlin’s most vocal critic and anticorruption crusader, Aleksei A. Navalny, said in a report published on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Russia/03Russia-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Russia/03Russia-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Russia/03Russia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Russia/03Russia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1427, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/world/03Russia/03Russia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType'