al Revenue Service after failing to file tax returns for seven years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Likability goes a long way in “Love & Taxes,” a comedy that relies on the friendly style of its star to carry a rambling story. If there aren’t many big laughs here, there are enough smiles to make the time pass pleasantly enough.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: It’s All Mirth and Taxes in ‘Love & Taxes’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s Inevitable, Mirth and Taxes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Love & Taxes (Movie)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kornbluth, Jacob', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kornbluth, Josh', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-02T21:44:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Jaworowski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jaworowski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/34368d7c-fc00-59eb-bf02-59d057def314', 'word_count': 246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34368d7c-fc00-59eb-bf02-59d057def314'}, {'abstract': 'Called “The Romanoffs,” this drama will be an 8-episode anthology about people who believe they are descendants of the former ruling family of Russia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/arts/television/matthew-weiner-new-amazon-series-romanoffs.html', 'snippet': 'Called “The Romanoffs,” this drama will be an 8-episode anthology about people who believe they are descendants of the former ruling family of Russia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Russia, a daily fixture in the nation’s headlines these days, will also fi