d minds of New Yorkers, but he has been trumpeting his successes across the country to fill his coffers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/nyregion/five-boroughs-more-like-five-cities-for-mayor-de-blasio.html', 'snippet': 'Bill de Blasio, who is running for re-election, may not have won the hearts and minds of New Yorkers, but he has been trumpeting his successes across the country to fill his coffers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’re looking for Mayor Bill de Blasio, don’t call City Hall. He leaves for Chicago on Friday morning, goes to Fort Lauderdale, Fla., on Saturday, then heads to Los Angeles on Sunday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/nyregion/03about/03about-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/03/nyregion/03about/03about-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/nyregion/03about/03about-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/nyregion/03about/03about-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/nyregion/03about/03about-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/03/nyregion/03about/03about-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'c