': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/02/crosswords/takes-the-edge-off-jumpsuit-richest-country.html', 'snippet': 'Take the edge off your week with a crunchy Patrick Berry puzzle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRIDAY PUZZLE — When you see someone refer to a puzzle as “crunchy,” it usually means that there is a good helping of fresh or lively entries and a buffet of tough cluing, and that it is generally a grid into which you can really sink your teeth. You know when you’ve solved a crunchy puzzle. You might have broken a slight sweat, you’re smiling and you might even quietly utter the word “Wow.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/crosswords/03wordplay-race/03wordplay-race-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/03/crosswords/03wordplay-race/03wordplay-race-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/crosswords/03wordplay-race/03wordplay-race-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/crosswords/03wordplay-race/03wordplay-race-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/03/crosswords/03wordplay-race/03wordplay-race-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/03/crosswords/03wordplay-race/03wordplay-race-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 589, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo