_paragraph': 'NBCUniversal’s hottest new mini-series stars its boss, Steve Burke, as the explorer Juan Ponce de León in his epic quest for the Fountain of Youth. The New York media conglomerate, housed inside the cable colossus Comcast, plunked $500 million into the supercharged stock debut of Snap on Thursday. The investment follows similar ones in a multitude of other millennial hunters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For NBCUniversal, Snap Is Fountain of Youth', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBCUniversal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Snap Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Comcast Corporation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-03T23:33:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Goldfarb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldfarb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ad8ed1a-cce5-57c8-a812-6e7809f7f0db', 'word_count': 360, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ad8ed1a-cce5-57c8-a812-6e7809f7f0db'}, {'abstract': 'A weekly wrap-up the of Times Canada related coverage from the past week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/03/world/canada/medicine-hat-canada-homelessness.html', 'snippet': 'A weekly wrap-up the of Times Canada related coverage from the past week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In many Canadian cities, winter provides a grim reminder of the civic shame of homelessness. Wherever there’s a vent providing