 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1964705-cf99-5eb8-9ae1-4a8155add5cd', 'word_count': 228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1964705-cf99-5eb8-9ae1-4a8155add5cd'}, {'abstract': 'The research on the benefits of diversity does not bode well for our mostly white, mostly male administration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/04/opinion/sunday/what-biracial-people-know.html', 'snippet': 'The research on the benefits of diversity does not bode well for our mostly white, mostly male administration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After the nation’s first black president, we now have a white president with the whitest and malest cabinet since Ronald Reagan’s. His administration immediately made it a priority to deport undocumented immigrants and to deny people from certain Muslim-majority nations entry into the United States, decisions that caused tremendous blowback.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/opinion/sunday/05velasquez/05velasquez-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/05/opinion/sunday/05velasquez/05velasquez-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/opinion/sunday/05velasquez/05velasquez-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/opinion/sunday/05velasquez/05velasquez-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/05/opinion/sunday/05velasquez/05velasquez-articleLarge.j