ey general, Sally Q. Yates, before she was fired by President Trump, will join the British firm’s white-collar defense practice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/05/business/dealbook/matthew-axelrod-justice-dept-linklaters-law-firm.html', 'snippet': 'Matthew S. Axelrod, the deputy to the acting attorney general, Sally Q. Yates, before she was fired by President Trump, will join the British firm’s white-collar defense practice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'His boss was fired, and in effect, so was he. Now Matthew S. Axelrod is moving on.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Former Deputy at the Justice Dept. Joins Linklaters Law Firm', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Former Justice Dept. Deputy Joins Linklaters Firm', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Axelrod,  Matthew S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Linklaters LLP', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yates, Sally Q (1960- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legal Profession', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-05T22:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elizabeth Olson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Olson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ead6cb24-3ee6-5a15-91bf-7399f2178595', 'word_count': 432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ead6cb24-3ee6-5a15-91