ed eggplant has a garlicky kick and is lighter than most. A dollop of her skordalia, a purée of potato and garlic, will elevate mashed potatoes. The unusual pougi is a tangy, lightly spiced mix of yogurt and feta. And tzatziki with cucumber, yogurt and garlic has a fresh, crunchy texture: Loi Dips, $6.99 for eight ounces at Whole Foods Markets.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/08/dining/08BURNER-DIP/08BURNER-DIP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/08/dining/08BURNER-DIP/08BURNER-DIP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/08/dining/08BURNER-DIP/08BURNER-DIP-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/08/dining/08BURNER-DIP/08BURNER-DIP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/08/dining/08BURNER-DIP/08BURNER-DIP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/08/dining/08BURNER-DIP/08BURNER-DIP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/08/dining/08BURNER-DIP/08BURNER-DIP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1524, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tzatziki, Skordalia and Other Greek Dips Bring the Taverna Home', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Spread: Dips From a Greek Chef Bring the Taverna Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Loi, Maria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-06T17:36:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a5e51bc9-4044-5603-b13d-6bcc52a940b9', 'word_count': 94, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5e51bc9-4044-5603-b13d-6bcc52a940b9'}, {'abstract': 'In a new book, the social psychologist Adam Alter warns that our devotion to digital devices has morphed into something very much like addiction.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/06/science/technology-addiction-irresistible-by-adam-alter.html', 'snippet': 'In a new book, the social psychologist Adam Alter warns that our devotion to digital devices has morphed into something very much like addiction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a new book, “Irresistible: The Rise of Addictive Technology and the Business of Keeping Us Hooked,” the social psychologist Adam Alter warns that many of us — youngsters, teenagers, adults — are addicted to modern digital products. Not figuratively, but literally addicted.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/07/science/07CONVERSATION/07CONV