164d9c3-e705-5051-87d2-ba15860f1a49'}, {'abstract': 'For the New Group’s production of “Evening at the Talk House,” Monique Carboni designed original posters for 30 fictional shows that line the walls of a bar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/06/theater/now-thats-a-play-id-like-to-see.html', 'snippet': 'For the New Group’s production of “Evening at the Talk House,” Monique Carboni designed original posters for 30 fictional shows that line the walls of a bar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rosa Ruiz’s play “Margarita’s Release” is a thriller about a supermodel ex-con turned C.I.A. operative. It’s a musical comedy about a nun who leaves the convent to start a line of erotic kimonos. It’s an immersive tragedy about a woman and margaritas. The great thing about Monique Carboni’s poster for the play is that it’s about all and none of those.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05TALKPOSTERS-COMBO/05POSTERS-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05TALKPOSTERS-COMBO/05POSTERS-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05TALKPOSTERS-COMBO/05POSTERS-COMBO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05TALKPOSTERS-COMBO/05POSTERS-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 239, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/05/arts/05TALKPOSTERS-COMBO/05POSTERS-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 23