 'Conforto conferred with the Mets’ hitting coaches in September and stayed in touch during the winter. The end result has thrilled the Mets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PORT ST. LUCIE, Fla. — Near the end of a vexing 2016 season for Michael Conforto, two of his coaches sat him down to talk. He was not playing much, so the Mets’ hitting coach, Kevin Long, and his assistant, Pat Roessler, used the opportunity to tell Conforto what they wanted him to improve on, especially when he had more time to think about things in the calm of the off-season.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/06/sports/06CONFORTO1/06CONFORTO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/06/sports/06CONFORTO1/06CONFORTO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/06/sports/06CONFORTO1/06CONFORTO1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/06/sports/06CONFORTO1/06CONFORTO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/06/sports/06CONFORTO1/06CONFORTO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/06/sports/06CONFORTO1/06CONFORTO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/06/s