': 'nyt://article/aea63985-c0e8-50a3-aef3-4bf45523ed3e'}, {'abstract': 'Jon Ossoff, a 30-year-old running for the House seat vacated by Tom Price, has raised about $3 million while 11 Republican candidates fight for attention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/08/us/jon-ossoff-georgia-special-election.html', 'snippet': 'Jon Ossoff, a 30-year-old running for the House seat vacated by Tom Price, has raised about $3 million while 11 Republican candidates fight for attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALPHARETTA, Ga. — Jon Ossoff is a 30-year-old Democrat who has never served in an elected position, running for Congress in a decidedly conservative district. But thanks to his online pitch to voters — “Make Trump Furious” — he has improbably found himself awash in donations: roughly $3 million, his campaign says, while 11 Republican candidates are scrapping for attention.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/09/us/09Georgia-1/00georgia-web01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/09/us/09Georgia-1/00georgia-web01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/09/us/09Georgia-1/00georgia-web01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/09/us/09Georgia-1/00georgia-web01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/09/us/09Georgia-1/00georgia-web01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 435}}, {'rank': 0