/living-in-greenfield-hill-ct-for-nature-lovers-and-privacy.html', 'snippet': 'This Fairfield neighborhood with a historic district offers good value as buyers’ tastes have shifted to areas closer to downtown and the beach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lisa and James Greenberg had lived in Fairfield, Conn., for almost 20 years when they decided they wanted a house with more privacy and entertaining space than their split-level in the North Stratfield section. They liked Fairfield, so they focused on another neighborhood, Greenfield Hill, with a historic district at its center. The area’s large lots, old-growth shade trees and winding lanes seemed to offer the space and seclusion the Greenbergs desired. But it took a long time to find a house that wasn’t too remote or had more land than they wanted to maintain.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/realestate/12LIVING-GREENFIELDHILL-slide-UM59/12LIVING-GREENFIELDHILL-slide-UM59-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/12/realestate/12LIVING-GREENFIELDHILL-slide-UM59/12LIVING-GREENFIELDHILL-slide-UM59-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/realestate/12LIVING-GREENFIELDHILL-slide-UM59/12LIVING-GREENFIELDHILL-slide-UM59-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/realestate/12LIVING-GREENFIELDHILL-slide-UM59/12LIVING-GREENFIELDHILL-slide-UM59-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1438, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thu