he-innovations-of-thomas-edison.html', 'snippet': 'From Pennsylvania Station, take the train to the Thomas Edison Center at Menlo Park to learn about the inventor’s highly productive (1,093 patents) life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s a brighter idea than it may first appear to visit the Thomas Edison Center at Menlo Park in Edison, N.J. Guideposts like a giant light bulb sculpture and an Art Deco concrete tower topped with a nearly 14-foot bulb dwarf the two-room museum, at 37 Christie Street. The center looks like nothing more than a gatehouse, which indeed it once was.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/nyregion/12DAYTRIP2/12DAYTRIP2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/12/nyregion/12DAYTRIP2/12DAYTRIP2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/nyregion/12DAYTRIP2/12DAYTRIP2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/nyregion/12DAYTRIP2/12DAYTRIP2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/12/nyregion/12DAYTRIP2/12DAYTRIP2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/nyregion/12DAYTRIP2/12DAYTRIP2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': N