acking district, beauty days at Bloomingdale’s and Barneys, and more.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Celebrate the end of winter at the meatpacking district’s fourth annual Open Market block party on Thursday from 6:30 to 10:30 p.m. There will be bites from neighborhood spots, including Scarpetta and Bodega Negra, fashion finds from local labels like a Rebecca Taylor floral print blouse ($100, originally $275) at sample sale prices, and Theophilus London and Coco and Breezy on deck. Tickets ($150) at openmarketnyc.com At Highline Stages, 441 West 14th Street.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/09/fashion/09SCOUT1/09SCOUT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/09/fashion/09SCOUT1/09SCOUT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/09/fashion/09SCOUT1/09SCOUT1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/09/fashion/09SCOUT1/09SCOUT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/09/fashion/09SCOUT1/09SCOUT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/09/fashion/09SCOUT1/09SCOUT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/09/fashion/09SCOUT1/09