t://article/fd40abac-9f3a-5370-b55b-5f11b41997d1'}, {'abstract': 'After four years online, the women’s humor magazine is hosting a live comedy series, as well as selling merchandise and a mock self-help book.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/09/style/reductress-satire-upright-citizens-brigade-how-to-win-at-feminism.html', 'snippet': 'After four years online, the women’s humor magazine is hosting a live comedy series, as well as selling merchandise and a mock self-help book.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stumbling unaware into a standup show is a mistake New York City tourists make daily. But at the Upright Citizens Brigade Theater in Chelsea, on the second Thursday of January, audience members did not seem confused as to why they were sipping beer in a dark cellar, awaiting the first act of the monthly comedy night staged by Reductress, the soon-to-be four-year-old satirical online magazine. The self-selecting crowd appeared, like the site’s readership, to be made up of liberal-minded women.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12REDUCTRESS3-WEB/12REDUCTRESS3-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12REDUCTRESS3-WEB/12REDUCTRESS3-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12REDUCTRESS3-WEB/12REDUCTRESS3-WEB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12REDUCTRESS3-WEB/12REDUCTRESS3-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlar