42ac-5ba1-5166-baf7-dcd698302122'}, {'abstract': 'A prison term for the leader of the Milah Abraham sect was the latest in a government push against new faiths, which human rights groups say face increasing persecution.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/09/world/asia/indonesia-blasphemy-laws.html', 'snippet': 'A prison term for the leader of the Milah Abraham sect was the latest in a government push against new faiths, which human rights groups say face increasing persecution.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JAKARTA, Indonesia — Back in his days as a badminton coach with the Indonesian national team, Ahmad Mushaddeq traveled the world on the state’s dime. But after he became the spiritual leader of a back-to-the-land organic farming movement on the island of Borneo, regarded by his followers as the messiah who succeeded Muhammad, the government locked him up for the second time on charges of blasphemy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/08/world/08INDONESIA-BLASPHEMY-1/08INDONESIA-BLASPHEMY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/08/world/08INDONESIA-BLASPHEMY-1/08INDONESIA-BLASPHEMY-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/08/world/08INDONESIA-BLASPHEMY-1/08INDONESIA-BLASPHEMY-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/08/world/08INDONESIA-BLASPHEMY-1/08INDONESIA-BLASPHEMY-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type