s not follow the corporate calendar or Instagram’s whims reluctantly sat for an unusual, untitled film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/09/fashion/documentary-fashion-azzedine-alaia.html', 'snippet': 'A tempestuous designer who does not follow the corporate calendar or Instagram’s whims reluctantly sat for an unusual, untitled film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Famous but underappreciated has become a foolproof template for documentary subjects in recent years, used in films as disparate as “Searching for Sugar Man,” “20 Feet From Stardom” and “My Architect.” Add to the trope a cinematic fascination with fashion and you have the basis for a poetic documentary about a tempestuous and imposingly gifted Tunisian-born French designer who, while exalted among cognoscenti, is all but unknown to the wider world.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12AZZEDINE-web/12AZZEDINE-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12AZZEDINE-web/12AZZEDINE-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12AZZEDINE-web/12AZZEDINE-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12AZZEDINE-web/12AZZEDINE-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/12/fashion/12AZZEDINE-web/12AZZEDINE-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'captio