 film, the musical begins previews at the August Wilson Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/10/theater/groundhog-day-offers-repetition-offers-repetition.html', 'snippet': 'Based on the 1993 Bill Murray film, the musical begins previews at the August Wilson Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bill Murray’s indelible performance as a jaded, delightfully obnoxious weatherman in the 1993 film “Groundhog Day” is a hard act to follow — even if the movie proved that repetition offers comic rewards. In any case, after a well-received run in London last summer, a new musical based on the movie about that weatherman having to relive the same day repeatedly, arrives on Broadway this month (hopefully bringing spring weather along with it).', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/arts/12GUIDE2/12GUIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/12/arts/12GUIDE2/12GUIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/arts/12GUIDE2/12GUIDE2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/arts/12GUIDE2/12GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/12/arts/12GUIDE2/12GUIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/arts/12GUIDE2/12GUIDE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': '