d put him in a strong position to win re-election in 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — Prime Minister Narendra Modi led his party to a landslide victory in India’s largest state on Saturday, consolidating his power and putting him in a strong position to win re-election in 2019.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Narendra Modi’s B.J.P. Party Wins Big in Uttar Pradesh, India’s Largest State', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Modi’s Party Wins Big in India’s Largest State', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Modi, Narendra', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uttar Pradesh State (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bharatiya Janata Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-11T13:15:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Geeta Anand', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Geeta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anand', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d192325-484e-5058-8504-635e51cdf5b3', 'word_count': 1138, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d192325-484e-5058-8504-635e51cdf5b3'}, {'abstract': 'While immigration, health care and Russia are hogging the media oxygen, big reversals are happening in Obama-era tech policy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/11/technology/farhads-and-cecilias-week-in-tech-tech-policy.html', 'snippet': 'While immigration, health care and Russia are hogging the media oxygen, big reversals are happening in Obama-era tech policy.', 'lead_paragraph':