elated newsletter, we asked you to share explorations of your family history, after Monica Drake, travel editor at The Times, wrote about hers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/11/us/reader-responses-to-our-underground-railroad-issue.html', 'snippet': 'In the March 5 edition of the Race/Related newsletter, we asked you to share explorations of your family history, after Monica Drake, travel editor at The Times, wrote about hers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the March 5 edition of the Race/Related newsletter, we asked you to share explorations of your family history, after Monica Drake, travel editor at The Times, wrote about hers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reader Responses to Our Underground Railroad Issue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2017-03-11T18:49:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03905988-bd44-5d66-a3e5-25afaf0606db', 'word_count': 861, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03905988-bd44-5d66-a3e5-25afaf0606db'}, {'abstract': 'We have nothing to lose but our electronic chains.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/11/opinion/sunday/resist-the-internet.html', 'snippet': 'We have nothing to lose but our electronic chains.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So far, in my ongoing series of columns making the case for implausible ideas, I’ve fixed race relations and solved the problem of a workless working class. So now it’s time to turn to the real threat to the human future: the one in your pocket or on your desk, the one you might be reading this column on right now.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12