tps://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/11/us/michael-brown-ferguson-police-shooting-video.html', 'snippet': 'A documentary says security footage suggests that the young man may not have been stealing from a Ferguson, Mo., convenience store before he was shot by the police.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the two and a half years since Michael Brown, a black 18-year-old, was shot and killed by a white police officer in Ferguson, Mo., the explosive case has been parsed in intricate detail. Witnesses offered varying descriptions of the fatal encounter. Investigators examined bloodstain evidence on the street where Mr. Brown died. And the police released a security video from a nearby store that showed Mr. Brown pushing a worker and taking cigarillos minutes before the shooting.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/us/12Ferguson-sub/12Ferguson-1489251477001-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 454, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/12/us/12Ferguson-sub/12Ferguson-1489251477001-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 454}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/us/12Ferguson-sub/12Ferguson-1489251477001-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 774, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/us/12Ferguson-sub/12Ferguson-1489251477001-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1440, 'width': 1905, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/12/us/12Ferguson-sub/12Ferguson-sub-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop