y, March 13, 2017.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s in my blood. It’s the family name. I’ve done enough to disgrace our name. I want to do everything I can to mend it.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: As Heroin Infests Farms, a Grieving Parent Fears for the Future', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2017-03-13T01:08:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/a56b58d1-81a9-5470-aaea-a8c6ab5fa0cf', 'word_count': 62, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a56b58d1-81a9-5470-aaea-a8c6ab5fa0cf'}, {'abstract': 'In his tenure as a United States attorney, which ended with his firing by the Trump administration, Mr. Bharara harped on one theme: Politics and prosecution do not mix.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/12/nyregion/preet-bharara-politics-us-attorney.html', 'snippet': 'In his tenure as a United States attorney, which ended with his firing by the Trump administration, Mr. Bharara harped on one theme: Politics and prosecution do not mix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ten days into his tenure as United States attorney in Manhattan, Preet Bharara saw his political and prosecutorial worlds collide.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/13/nyregion/13preet/13preet-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/13/nyregion/13preet/13preet-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'ty