i': 'nyt://article/56a9919a-25d1-5e4f-9cde-36068ce0a0c6'}, {'abstract': 'Robert Smithson’s land-art classic joins other symbols of the state including the beehive, the Dutch oven and the M1911 pistol.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/13/arts/design/spiral-jetty-is-named-an-official-state-work-of-art-by-utah.html', 'snippet': 'Robert Smithson’s land-art classic joins other symbols of the state including the beehive, the Dutch oven and the M1911 pistol.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The great American sculptor Robert Smithson, who died in a plane crash in 1973 at the age of 35, was as interested in the history of the Earth as he was in the history of art. He once considered becoming a geologist and said that as a reader, “the entire history of the West was swallowed up” for him “in a preoccupation with notions of prehistory and the great prehistoric epics starting with the age of rocks.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/14/arts/14JETTY/14JETTY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/14/arts/14JETTY/14JETTY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/14/arts/14JETTY/14JETTY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/14/arts/14JETTY/14JETTY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1331, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/14/arts/14JETTY/14JETTY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,