 Baseball Classic', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Left Out of a Tiebreaker Game, Mexico Protests, but to No Avail', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Baseball Classic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-13T17:30:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Wagner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wagner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/544260e3-9d2f-5bbe-acb3-cd6230df82b3', 'word_count': 841, 'uri': 'nyt://article/544260e3-9d2f-5bbe-acb3-cd6230df82b3'}, {'abstract': 'The cellist and the composer discuss the piece, which the New York Philharmonic plays on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/13/arts/music/yo-yo-ma-esa-pekka-salonen-concerto.html', 'snippet': 'The cellist and the composer discuss the piece, which the New York Philharmonic plays on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — A few years ago, after they had shared more than a couple postconcert martinis, Yo-Yo Ma had a request for the composer and conductor Esa-Pekka Salonen: Write me a concerto.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/14/arts/14YOYO/14YOYO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/14/arts/14YOYO/14YOYO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt