ump’s efforts to transform Medicaid, expand Medicare and upend the Affordable Care Act.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Senate on Monday confirmed Seema Verma, a health policy expert from Indiana, to lead efforts by the Trump administration to transform Medicaid and upend the Affordable Care Act.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Policy Expert Is Confirmed as Medicare and Medicaid Administrator', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Policy Expert Will Take Reins at Medicare and Medicaid Agency', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicaid', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Verma, Seema', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-13T22:46:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Pear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pear', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c719ef5d-f749-50a4-af98-505112a50047', 'word_count': 821, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c719ef5d-f749-50a4-af98-505112a50047'}, {'abstract': 'His work was internationally renowned, but Professor Shafarevich’s reputation as an anti-Soviet dissident was later tarnished by accusations of anti-Semitism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/13/world/europe/igor-shafarevich-dead-dissident-mathematician.html', 'snippet': 'His work was internationally renowned, but Professor Shafarevich’s reputation as an anti-Soviet dissident was later tarnished by accusations of anti-Semitism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Igor Shafarevich, an internationally renowned Russian mathem