', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab8f0bcd-f26f-5f43-8bcf-41fc508297c7', 'word_count': 270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab8f0bcd-f26f-5f43-8bcf-41fc508297c7'}, {'abstract': 'While Billie Holiday’s short life was filled with hardship, Jerry Dantzic documented not the tragic torch singer of myth but a middle-aged woman finding simple comforts from the maelstrom.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2017/03/14/backstage-with-billie-holiday-jerry-dantzic/', 'snippet': 'While Billie Holiday’s short life was filled with hardship, Jerry Dantzic documented not the tragic torch singer of myth but a middle-aged woman finding simple comforts from the maelstrom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Billie Holiday was a great American storyteller and a great American story. Her working materials were simple pop songs and standards — rarely blues — but her medium was her body itself: her voice, her back story. The past imprinted its lines on her skin; the future seemed to be running out. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Backstage With Billie Holiday', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voice and Speech', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dantzic, Jerry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holiday, Billie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Hall', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Newark (NJ)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-14T07:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Leland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organiza