one, 'lastname': 'Liptak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/96ccb62d-4059-559e-b98f-ee3cb67bee1a', 'word_count': 956, 'uri': 'nyt://article/96ccb62d-4059-559e-b98f-ee3cb67bee1a'}, {'abstract': 'She spent about $4,500 and 26 hours on the prep. Who said it had to be perfect? (But it was.)', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/16/fashion/weddings/planning-a-wedding-in-a-week.html', 'snippet': 'She spent about $4,500 and 26 hours on the prep. Who said it had to be perfect? (But it was.)', 'lead_paragraph': 'Emily Hardman said there were only two times she felt momentary anxiety: when she didn’t have a dress, and when she couldn’t quite figure out the flow of the reception program. “But then I decided to let it go, figuring it would work out, and that people couldn’t really be disappointed with five days of wedding planning,” she said. “It’s amazing how fast you can actually plan a wedding.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/19HARDMANSIDE8/19HARDMANSIDE8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/19HARDMANSIDE8/19HARDMANSIDE8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/19HARDMANSIDE8/19HARDMANSIDE8-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/19HARDMANSIDE8/19HARDMANSIDE8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/19HARDMANSIDE8/19HARDMANSIDE8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/19HARDMANSIDE8/19HARDMANSIDE8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/19HARDMANSIDE8/19HARDMANSIDE8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Here’s How She Planned Her Wedding in a Week', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How She Did It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-16T18:03:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'As told to LeAnn Wilcox', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2554392b-171a-5efc-9e9f-cf428dd87115', 'word_count': 546, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2554392b-171a-5efc-9e9f-cf428dd87115'}, {'abstract': 'I was certain that modern weddings were unnecessarily burdensome. My theory: You could plan a beautiful wedding in a week. I had a chance to prove it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/16/fashion/weddings/wedding-planning-in-5-days.html', 'snippet': 'I was certain that modern weddings were unnecessarily burdensome. My theory: You could plan a beautiful wedding in a week. I had a chance to prove it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was the day before my wedding, and I still didn’t have a dress. In less than 24 hours, family and friends would be gathering to celebrate the occasion, and at this point my “something borrowed” was going to be an entire church outfit. Was I concerned? Not really, and not for long. I decided to throw a Hail Mary at my mom by asking if she would make a skirt to match the $10 top I found. She did. And it was lovely.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/weddings/19HARDMANSIDE2/19HARDMANSIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/weddings/19HARDMANSIDE2/19HARDMANSIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/weddings/19HARDMANSIDE2/19HARDMANSIDE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/weddings/19HARDMANSIDE2/19HARDMANSIDE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1288, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/weddings/19HARDMANSIDE2/19HARDMANSIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/weddings/19HARDMANSIDE2/19HARDMANSIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/fashion/weddings/19HARDMANSIDE2/19HARDMANSIDE2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'sub