on': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ccafdaa-e77f-56d4-8c1b-907c9f411f18', 'word_count': 1040, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ccafdaa-e77f-56d4-8c1b-907c9f411f18'}, {'abstract': 'A documentary looks at a hedge fund manager’s $1 billion bet against that nutritional company and his efforts to expose what he characterized as consumer fraud.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/16/movies/betting-on-zero-review.html', 'snippet': 'A documentary looks at a hedge fund manager’s $1 billion bet against that nutritional company and his efforts to expose what he characterized as consumer fraud.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The topic of “Betting on Zero” might initially seem better suited to the business pages. The film chronicles the hedge fund manager William A. Ackman’s crusade against Herbalife, a nutritional-products company that sells its goods through a chain of civilian distributors.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Betting on Zero’ Tracks a Crusade Against Herbalife', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Betting on Zero', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Betting on Zero (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Herbalife Ltd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Braun, Theodore', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ackman, William A', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Michael O', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pershing Square Capital Management', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-16T21:36:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'