search of style and attitude in Ivory Coast.', 'lead_paragraph': '“If you want to shoot fashion in New York, you’re probably going to hang out in very trendy spots,” the photographer Émilie Régnier said. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Seeking Style in the Markets of Abidjan, Ivory Coast', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ivory Coast', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-17T21:17:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kerri MacDonald and Eve Lyons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kerri', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacDonald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Eve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc068fec-6d09-5865-bdae-465cd7adbb3d', 'word_count': 720, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc068fec-6d09-5865-bdae-465cd7adbb3d'}, {'abstract': 'Since the election, several companies have amped up their marketing strategies to pitch their products using outright partisan messages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/17/arts/the-trump-resistance-will-be-commercialized.html', 'snippet': 'Since the election, several companies have amped up their marketing strategies to pitch their products using outright partisan messages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Recently I received an email inviting me to attend a private salon held at a Brooklyn restaurant. “Under this new … ahem … ‘administrati