ything about it until we mentioned it. Then, when we were away again, they cut back the tree in our front yard. In both cases, they cut without regard to how the trees look or whether they would grow back. If they had asked, we would have trimmed the trees. Can we do anything? I know they can trim what hangs on their side, but they could destroy the trees.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/realestate/19ASKSUB/19ASKSUB-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 108, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/19/realestate/19ASKSUB/19ASKSUB-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 108}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/realestate/19ASKSUB/19ASKSUB-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 184, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/realestate/19ASKSUB/19ASKSUB-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/realestate/19ASKSUB/19ASKSUB-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/19/realestate/19ASKSUB/19ASKSUB-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/realestate/19ASKSUB/19ASKSUB-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Neighbo