nimous, verdict as the capacity crowd, which had been wildly pro-Golovkin early, booed the call.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/18/sports/daniel-jacobs-gennady-golovkin-weigh-in.html', 'snippet': 'Golovkin was awarded a narrow, but unanimous, verdict as the capacity crowd, which had been wildly pro-Golovkin early, booed the call.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was the least likely of results — two fighters who had scored 35 straight knockouts between them and neither of them having heard the final bell of a fight in more than eight years — but no one who saw Saturday night’s middleweight title fight between Gennady Golovkin and Daniel Jacobs left Madison Square Garden disappointed.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/sports/19boxing-web3/19boxing-web3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/19/sports/19boxing-web3/19boxing-web3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/sports/19boxing-web3/19boxing-web3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/sports/19boxing-web3/19boxing-web3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1433, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/19/sports/19boxing-web3/19boxing-web3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/19/sports/19boxing-web3/19boxing-web3-