Crossword.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/19/crosswords/quite-a-distance-off-garp-scales-nobel.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Neil deGrasse Tyson and Andrea Carla Michaels help continue our celebration of the 75th anniversary of The New York Times Crossword.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONDAY PUZZLE — We are a society that tends to walk around with our eyes glued to our smartphones, but today’s puzzle is a wonderful reminder to “look up,” as my Facebook friend Aryan Mishra likes to say. Mr. Mishra, currently a 17-year-old student in Delhi, India, achieved prominence in 2014 when he and a fellow student discovered an asteroid in a competition and, if he continues in his chosen path as an aspiring astronaut, he might well eventually meet up with one of today’s crossword constructors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/20/crosswords/20wordplay-space/20wordplay-space-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/20/crosswords/20wordplay-space/20wordplay-space-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/20/crosswords/20wordplay-space/20wordplay-space-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/20/crosswords/20wordplay-space/20wordplay-space-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/20/crosswords/20wordplay-space/20wordplay-space-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i