 Fresh (Queens, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Express Tea Shop (Queens, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-20T19:41:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ligaya Mishan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ligaya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mishan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dba4986b-a73e-594f-b317-2bdeebaaf1b0', 'word_count': 1163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dba4986b-a73e-594f-b317-2bdeebaaf1b0'}, {'abstract': 'The F.B.I. director, James B. Comey, confirmed an investigation into possible collusion by the Trump campaign and Russia. Here are the other key takeaways.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/20/us/politics/takeaways-russia-intelligence-committee-hearing.html', 'snippet': 'The F.B.I. director, James B. Comey, confirmed an investigation into possible collusion by the Trump campaign and Russia. Here are the other key takeaways.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The House Intelligence Committee usually meets behind closed doors to talk about secrets. But on Monday it made an exception, noting the intense public interest in its topic: the interference by Russian intelligence in the American election. The hearing shed some official light on a topic that has been the subject of a great deal of media reporting — and gave members of both parties a chance to score political points. Here are the highlights.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Highlights From the House Hearing on Russian Interference in the U.S. Election', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Where Things Stand After a Day of Testimony', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'va