 'word_count': 685, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e9bad21-7a73-527f-a53c-f5ea250b1610'}, {'abstract': 'Why is that man wearing a wooden bench? Why does that woman have her head in a lounge chair? Mr. Wurm incorporates people into his sculptures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/22/arts/design/erwin-wurm-brings-one-minute-sculptures-to-lehmann-maupin.html', 'snippet': 'Why is that man wearing a wooden bench? Why does that woman have her head in a lounge chair? Mr. Wurm incorporates people into his sculptures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Why is that man wearing a wooden bench? Why does that woman have her head in a lounge chair? These are among the questions raised by the Austrian artist Erwin Wurm’s “Ethics demonstrated in geometrical order,” a new series of his “One Minute Sculptures” that goes on view Thursday, March 30, at the Lehmann Maupin gallery.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/arts/26GUIDE4/26GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/26/arts/26GUIDE4/26GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/arts/26GUIDE4/26GUIDE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/arts/26GUIDE4/26GUIDE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1201, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/arts/26GUIDE4/26GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cr