ll be able to solve Sandy Ganzell’s New York Times Crossword debut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THURSDAY PUZZLE — This may sound strange to some of you, but I have this theory that irony is an excellent weight-management system. There are many types of diets — most dealing with the boring idea of eating less and moving around more — but I believe that the energy spent enjoying a good, healthy ironic twist will burn a hefty amount of calories. [She has absolutely no evidence to support this, but let’s humor her. — Ed.]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/23/crosswords/23wordplay-gym1/23wordplay-gym1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/23/crosswords/23wordplay-gym1/23wordplay-gym1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/23/crosswords/23wordplay-gym1/23wordplay-gym1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/23/crosswords/23wordplay-gym1/23wordplay-gym1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/23/crosswords/23wordplay-gym1/23wordplay-gym1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/23/crosswords/23wordplay-gym1/23wordplay-gym1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03