article/6b56ec76-781e-5a13-89bb-23039fd81601'}, {'abstract': 'In announcing the forced resignation, a city agency confirmed that leaked disciplinary records of the officer who placed Mr. Garner in a fatal chokehold, were authentic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/23/nyregion/ccrb-nypd-daniel-pantaleo-eric-garner.html', 'snippet': 'In announcing the forced resignation, a city agency confirmed that leaked disciplinary records of the officer who placed Mr. Garner in a fatal chokehold, were authentic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A New York City agency charged with investigating police wrongdoing on Thursday forced an employee to resign after discovering that the employee had leaked the disciplinary history of the officer who placed Eric Garner in a fatal chokehold. The agency also confirmed for the first time that the records, which showed that the officer faced no stronger punishment for abusing his authority than retraining and the loss of two vacation days, were authentic.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Employee Accused of Records Leak in Eric Garner Case Resigns', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Employee Forced Out for Leaking Officer’s File', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pantaleo, Daniel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Civilian Complaint Review Board', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-23T20:35:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Mueller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': 