rticle/1e41e2ae-2c48-5ead-916e-28c6cfd42c99', 'word_count': 898, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e41e2ae-2c48-5ead-916e-28c6cfd42c99'}, {'abstract': 'The borough presidents in Brooklyn, the Bronx, Manhattan, Staten Island and Queens talk about the present and the future of their parts of the city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/23/nyregion/borough-president-brooklyn-bronx-manhattan.html', 'snippet': 'The borough presidents in Brooklyn, the Bronx, Manhattan, Staten Island and Queens talk about the present and the future of their parts of the city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The position of borough president is not just ceremonial (although the job does involve cutting plenty of ribbons and wielding engraved shovels). The elected officials who represent the five boroughs of New York City also help decide land-use and zoning issues, allocate money and advocate for their neighbors with the mayor and the City Council.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/nyregion/26BOROUGH-ADAMS/26BOROUGH-ADAMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/26/nyregion/26BOROUGH-ADAMS/26BOROUGH-ADAMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/nyregion/26BOROUGH-ADAMS/26BOROUGH-ADAMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/nyregion/26BOROUGH-ADAMS/26BOROUGH-ADAMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type