 'nyt://article/e83c4958-36a4-55c1-8f9d-e6395871cc0e'}, {'abstract': 'She began their relationship with a jab at his university’s football team, but he had trouble reading her signals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/25/fashion/weddings/ginger-gibson-travis-burk-married.html', 'snippet': 'She began their relationship with a jab at his university’s football team, but he had trouble reading her signals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Virginia Stella Gibson and Travis Andrews Burk were married March 25 at Maison du Lac, an event space in New Orleans. The Very Rev. William A. J. Heine Jr., an Episcopal priest, officiated.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/fashion/weddings/26GIBSON/26GIBSON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/26/fashion/weddings/26GIBSON/26GIBSON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/fashion/weddings/26GIBSON/26GIBSON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/fashion/weddings/26GIBSON/26GIBSON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1119, 'width': 1537, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/26/fashion/weddings/26GIBSON/26GIBSON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/26/fashion/weddings/26GIBSON/26GIBSON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {