, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7602d396-e8a6-5087-9ed9-048769e49df7'}, {'abstract': 'Sunday’s episode raised some questions and addressed several outstanding ones from the past seven weeks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/26/arts/television/the-walking-dead-something-they-need-recap.html', 'snippet': 'Sunday’s episode raised some questions and addressed several outstanding ones from the past seven weeks.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Walking Dead” arranged the pieces on Sunday for next week’s Season 7 finale, in an episode called “Something They Need.” As is often the case, the title linked the various subplots, the somethings they needed including guns for the Alexandrians, security for Eugene and a way out for Sasha.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/24/arts/twd1/twd1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/24/arts/twd1/twd1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/24/arts/twd1/twd1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/24/arts/twd1/twd1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/24/arts/twd1/twd1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/24/arts/twd1/twd1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'