d States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Conference of Catholic Bishops', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-27T07:21:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Groome', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Groome', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/b64f0f67-4db1-5954-a0fb-b8309c74352a', 'word_count': 856, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b64f0f67-4db1-5954-a0fb-b8309c74352a'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Trump’s inaugural budget blueprint is a narrow-minded document that sacrifices American innovation to small-bore politics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/27/opinion/the-trump-administrations-war-on-science.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Trump’s inaugural budget blueprint is a narrow-minded document that sacrifices American innovation to small-bore politics.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Think of the marvels we can achieve if we simply set free the dreams of our people,” President Trump said in his speech to Congress last month, after summoning a list of technological triumphs from America’s past. “Cures to illnesses that have always plagued us,” and “American footprints on distant worlds.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/27/opinion/27mon1/27mon1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'wi