{'abstract': '“Rum: The Manual” covers the history of the world’s most diverse spirit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/27/dining/rum-the-manual-book-dave-broom.html', 'snippet': '“Rum: The Manual” covers the history of the world’s most diverse spirit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rum is made across the globe from sugar cane, and it can be distilled from free-run cane juice, sugar syrup or, most commonly, molasses. In “Rum: The Manual,” the writer Dave Broom explains its history, its possible origins in 13th-century India and its role in the Caribbean and colonial America. The book describes scores of rums according to style and provides cocktail recipes: “Rum: The Manual” by Dave Broom (Octopus Publishing $19.99).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/29/dining/29BURNER-BOOK/29BURNER-BOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 814, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/29/dining/29BURNER-BOOK/29BURNER-BOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 814}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/29/dining/29BURNER-BOOK/29BURNER-BOOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 756, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/29/dining/29BURNER-BOOK/29BURNER-BOOK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1146, 'width': 845, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/29/dining/29BURNER-BOOK/29BURNER-BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/29/dining