 'snippet': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on whether to tell your friend you think she is being used for her money, and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve been friends with “Cindy” for 15 years. She’s in her early 60s and never married. Because of job stress, she took early retirement and lives on a reduced pension. Despite not having a lot of money, she is generous, spoiling her family and friends with gifts. ', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/02/magazine/02ethicist/02ethicist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 344, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/02/magazine/02ethicist/02ethicist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 344, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/02/magazine/02ethicist/02ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/04/02/magazine/02ethicist/02ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/02/magazine/02ethicist/02ethicist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Friend Is Bankrupting Herself. Should I Speak Up?', 'kicker': 'The Ethicist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'My Friend Is Bankrupting Herself. Should I Speak Up?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subjec