: 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Rupert', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Ghost in the Shell (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-30T15:07:43+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By MEKADO MURPHY', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MURPHY', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/02b625d6-b059-5504-96eb-886e7a0061a9', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/02b625d6-b059-5504-96eb-886e7a0061a9'}, {'abstract': 'The director discusses a sequence from “Ghost in the Shell” featuring Scarlett Johansson.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/30/movies/rupert-sanders-narrates-a-scene-from-ghost-in-the-shell.html', 'snippet': 'The director discusses a sequence from “Ghost in the Shell” featuring Scarlett Johansson.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A cyborg takes a deep dive in this scene from “Ghost in the Shell,” the new live-action adaptation of a Japanese comic book. Here, the cyber-enhanced Major (Scarlett Johansson) goes inside the digital information found in a geisha robot to solve the mystery of how it was hacked. The robot’s digital memories are visualized as Major physically walks through them. The director Rupert Sanders discussed building robots, visualizing data onscreen and greasing up stuntmen for the sequence. Here are excerpts from that conversation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rupert Sanders Narrates a Scene From ‘Ghost in the Shell’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Rupert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johansson, Scarlett', 'rank': 3, 'ma