160172'}, {'abstract': 'Houston has an overloaded offense that could provide matchup problems for its American League rivals this season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/30/sports/baseball/mlb-opening-day-american-league.html', 'snippet': 'Houston has an overloaded offense that could provide matchup problems for its American League rivals this season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Houston Astros hired Jeff Luhnow to run their baseball operations after the 2011 season, the same winter the Chicago Cubs hired Theo Epstein to run theirs. Both men had earned championship rings already — Luhnow for growing the St. Louis Cardinals’ farm system, Epstein for building the Boston Red Sox. Then Epstein won another title last fall.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/31/sports/31ALPREVIEW1/31ALPREVIEW1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/31/sports/31ALPREVIEW1/31ALPREVIEW1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/31/sports/31ALPREVIEW1/31ALPREVIEW1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/31/sports/31ALPREVIEW1/31ALPREVIEW1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1509, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/31/sports/31ALPREVIEW1/31ALPREVIEW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/31/sport