rooklyn Academy of Music.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/30/arts/music/robert-hurwitz-nonesuch-celebration.html', 'snippet': 'Robert Hurwitz has led the label for over 30 years. On Saturday, his artists are giving him a concert of his own at the Brooklyn Academy of Music.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the last six months, Robert Hurwitz has been going through the daily journals he kept during more than 30 years at the helm of Nonesuch Records. In thousands of pages, he documented working with the musicians who have made Nonesuch perhaps the most eclectic label in the business: the composers Steve Reich and John Adams, jazz auteurs like Brad Mehldau, the arena-filling rock duo the Black Keys, and esteemed songwriters like Randy Newman and Stephin Merritt.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/31/arts/31HURWITZ/31HURWITZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/31/arts/31HURWITZ/31HURWITZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/31/arts/31HURWITZ/31HURWITZ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/31/arts/31HURWITZ/31HURWITZ-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/31/arts/31HURWITZ/31HURWITZ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/31/arts/31HUR