me unappetizing qualities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a day far more like February than March, I watched a turkey vulture struggle against a raging headwind along a southern Brooklyn street. I could see its destination: an unfortunate rabbit, flattened in the middle of the road. With a frothy Jamaica Bay for a background, the vulture extended its feet with the peculiar, almost respectful grace of a carrion eater, and had committed to landing when a speeding patrol car changed its plans.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/30/nyregion/02NATURE1/02NATURE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/03/30/nyregion/02NATURE1/02NATURE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/30/nyregion/02NATURE1/02NATURE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/30/nyregion/02NATURE1/02NATURE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/30/nyregion/02NATURE1/02NATURE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/03/30/nyregion/02NATURE1/02NATURE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/03/30/nyregion/02NATURE1/02NATURE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'widt