ow he plays for Juventus, and in Naples, that is almost too much to bear.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/31/sports/soccer/rotten-dirty-traitor-falls-into-the-juventus-napoli-divide.html', 'snippet': 'Gonzalo Higuaín scored 91 goals for Napoli, and fans loved him. Now he plays for Juventus, and in Naples, that is almost too much to bear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If Gonzalo Higuaín had any doubts about what lies in wait for him in Naples, the banner that appeared on the Ponte Maddalena Cerasuolo in northern Naples on Thursday morning would have swept them away. First, the banner accused him of being an “actor,” and then a “slave to the system.” The real venom, though, was in the final three words: “Marcio sporco traditore.”', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/02/sports/02ONSOCCER1/02ONSOCCER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/04/02/sports/02ONSOCCER1/02ONSOCCER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/02/sports/02ONSOCCER1/02ONSOCCER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/02/sports/02ONSOCCER1/02ONSOCCER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/02/sports/02ONSOCCER1/02ONSOCCER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/04/02/sports/02ON