 (Biological)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Journal of Evolutionary Biology', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Delia, Jesse', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bravo Valencia, Laura', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Panama', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evolution (Biology)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2017-03-31T11:00:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanna Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad2ab963-5921-5c40-ba81-bbf66ef0d124', 'word_count': 546, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ad2ab963-5921-5c40-ba81-bbf66ef0d124'}, {'abstract': 'A report by Variety says the “Buffy” creator is near a deal to write, direct and produce a stand-alone film centered on the D.C. Comics superhero.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2017/03/31/movies/joss-whedon-batgirl-movie.html', 'snippet': 'A report by Variety says the “Buffy” creator is near a deal to write, direct and produce a stand-alone film centered on the D.C. Comics superhero.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joss Whedon made his name by creating the television series “Buffy the Vampire Slayer,” centered on a strong female lead, and he has tried his hand at directing Shakespeare. Now, he is looking at tackling the story of a female superhero: Batgirl.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/01/world/01Batgirl/01Batgirl-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 904, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/04/01/world/0